  {
   "slug": "tidal-circuit-review",
   "title": "Tidal Circuit review: arcade racing at the speed of the tide",
   "date": "2026-10-15T14:30:00",
   "excerpt": "Neon tracks over a rising ocean make for the most frantic arcade racer in years, if you can forgive its menus.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Every track in Tidal Circuit floods as you race. Lap one is a clean neon ribbon; by lap three the water has risen and half the shortcuts are gone. It sounds like a gimmick, and for the first hour it feels like one, but it quickly becomes the whole game.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Drifting builds charge, charge lets you skim the water, and skimming opens routes no one else can reach. Top players are already posting lines that look impossible.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:columns --><div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Modes</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Grand Prix with twelve cups</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Rising Tide survival</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Split-screen for four</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Online ghost duels</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Settings worth changing</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Turn off motion blur for clarity</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Raise camera height one step</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Map drift to the shoulder button</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The menus are a maze and the unlock pace is slow, but once you are on the track none of that matters.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"pa-verdict\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group pa-verdict\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"pa-score\"} --><p class=\"pa-score\">8.2</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The verdict</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"pa-verdict__line\"} --><p class=\"pa-verdict__line\">Brilliant tracks, clumsy menus. Race first, ask questions later.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:columns --><div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"pa-pros\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group pa-pros\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} --><h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Power-ups</h4><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Flooding tracks change every lap</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Excellent split-screen</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Readable at high speed</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"pa-cons\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group pa-cons\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":4} --><h4 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Glitches</h4><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Confusing menus</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Slow unlocks</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --></div><!-- /wp:group -->",
   "categories": [
    "reviews"
   ],
   "tags": [
